### 3be0a77
test(state): add hooked state creation benchmark case

The blind-spots group names creation of a target that takes a second
symbol as a gap, but no case timed it. Add one shaped like the hookless
creation case with a single no-op onRead hook built once at module
level, so the next change can compare hooked creation against this
baseline.


